{"unit_id":"joao-paulo-santos__dsh-diff-view#card-zh","repo":"joao-paulo-santos/dsh-diff-view","commit":"f1ba0ced78292038cefb7b5fb8b937c5d69773ba","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-diff-view 是面向 DSH Web 客户端插件的可复用文本差异查看服务。它在浏览器端提供 diffView 服务，包含行级 LCS 差异引擎和可独立使用的差异组件。主要功能有双栏或统一视图、按 hunk 分组并折叠未变化区间、准确显示两侧行号、标记行内词语变化，以及可选语法高亮。其他插件可传入两段文本或预计算的 hunks 来展示差异，也可单独调用引擎构造自定义布局。适合需要在 DSH 插件中呈现文件变更或文本对比的开发者。无需 API 密钥、账号或外部服务；语法高亮依赖平台原语，不可用时显示纯文本。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:2-4","lib/client.js:39-37","lib/client.js:153-183","lib/client.js:272-277","lib/client.js:642-684"]}
{"unit_id":"joao-paulo-santos__dsh-diff-view#card-en","repo":"joao-paulo-santos/dsh-diff-view","commit":"f1ba0ced78292038cefb7b5fb8b937c5d69773ba","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-diff-view gives DSH web plugins a diff engine and viewer. It renders split or unified hunks with true line numbers, word highlights, and optional syntax colors. Plugins pass texts or hunks, or build custom layouts. No API key or external service is needed; highlighting falls back to plain text.","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:2-4","lib/client.js:39-37","lib/client.js:153-183","lib/client.js:272-277","lib/client.js:642-684"]}
