{"unit_id":"joao-paulo-santos__dsh-diff-view#feature-1","repo":"joao-paulo-santos/dsh-diff-view","commit":"f1ba0ced78292038cefb7b5fb8b937c5d69773ba","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-diff-view 的功能「文本差异引擎」：比较两组文本行并生成对齐结果与带上下文的 hunks。调用方传入 before 和 after 文本，可按需调整上下文行数，得到包含新旧行号的变更片段。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:86-136","lib/client.js:224-277"]}
{"unit_id":"joao-paulo-santos__dsh-diff-view#feature-2","repo":"joao-paulo-santos/dsh-diff-view","commit":"f1ba0ced78292038cefb7b5fb8b937c5d69773ba","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-diff-view 的功能「差异组件」：把文本对比结果渲染为 split 或 unified 视图。插件创建组件时传入文本或 hunks，也可控制视图模式、换行和滚动等显示选项。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:452-460","lib/client.js:642-684"]}
{"unit_id":"joao-paulo-santos__dsh-diff-view#feature-3","repo":"joao-paulo-santos/dsh-diff-view","commit":"f1ba0ced78292038cefb7b5fb8b937c5d69773ba","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-diff-view 的功能「行内词语标记」：对被替换的行进行词级比较，并分别标出删除与新增的词。组件在 split 和 unified 模式下都可呈现这些高亮。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:140-188","lib/client.js:329-349"]}
{"unit_id":"joao-paulo-santos__dsh-diff-view#feature-4","repo":"joao-paulo-santos/dsh-diff-view","commit":"f1ba0ced78292038cefb7b5fb8b937c5d69773ba","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-diff-view 的功能「交互式变更标记」：渲染时可传入行或 hunk 标记回调，并让新增、删除行可点击。调用方接收 hunk 与行索引，以实现选择状态或分段操作。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:467-515","lib/client.js:528-533"]}
